"High risk: review and select explicitly. Stop Cargo, rustc and rust-analyzer first. Every source file must match its retained crate archive and Cargo checksum evidence. Modified, unverified or credential-bearing crates are blocked. Archives, registry indexes, installed tools and configuration are retained." = "高风险：请逐项审阅并明确选择，先停止 Cargo、rustc 和 rust-analyzer。每个源文件都必须与保留的包归档及 Cargo 校验信息一致。已修改、未核验或包含凭据的包会被阻止。保留包归档、软件源索引、已安装工具和配置。";
"High risk: review and select explicitly. Stop Cargo, rustc and rust-analyzer first. Generated source is allowed only inside verified build-script OUT_DIR after Git and process checks. Preserve manual edits, custom deliverables and files that cannot be rebuilt." = "高风险：请逐项审阅并明确选择，先停止 Cargo、rustc 和 rust-analyzer。通过 Git 和进程检查后，仅可清理已核验构建脚本 OUT_DIR 内的生成源码。请保留手动修改、自定义交付物和无法重新构建的文件。";
"High risk: review and select explicitly. Stop Swift builds first. Only verified debug or release product directories are targeted; source checkouts, repositories, credentials and package configuration are retained. Preserve custom products and manual edits to generated source." = "高风险：请逐项审阅并明确选择，先停止 Swift 构建。仅清理已核验的 debug 或 release 产物目录；保留依赖源码、仓库、凭据和包配置。请保留自定义产物及生成源码中的手动修改。";
"High risk: select explicitly and stop CMake, Ninja, Make and compiler tasks first. Compiler probe source is allowed only in a verified CMake layout. Preserve authored files, custom binaries and outputs that cannot be rebuilt." = "高风险：请手动选择，并先停止 CMake、Ninja、Make 与编译器任务。仅允许清理已验证 CMake 布局中的编译器探测源码。请保留手写文件、自定义二进制及无法重新构建的产物。";
"High risk: select explicitly and stop Flutter, Dart and platform builds first. A pubspec.yaml project marker is required. Tracked files, credentials and authored source remain protected; preserve deployment outputs and local edits." = "高风险：请手动选择，并先停止 Flutter、Dart 及平台构建任务。项目必须包含 pubspec.yaml。版本控制中的文件、凭据和手写源码会受到保护；请保留部署产物与本地修改。";
"High risk: select explicitly and stop Gradle or Java tasks first. Only projects with a Gradle build file qualify. Tracked files, credentials and authored source remain protected; preserve custom deliverables and offline dependencies." = "高风险：请手动选择，并先停止 Gradle 或 Java 任务。仅匹配包含 Gradle 构建文件的项目。版本控制中的文件、凭据和手写源码会受到保护；请保留自定义交付物及离线依赖。";
"High risk: select explicitly and stop Maven or Java tasks first. Generated source requires Maven build metadata. Tracked files, credentials and authored source remain protected; preserve custom deliverables and local edits." = "高风险：请手动选择，并先停止 Maven 或 Java 任务。生成源码必须同时具有 Maven 构建元数据。版本控制中的文件、凭据和手写源码会受到保护；请保留自定义交付物与本地修改。";
"High risk: select explicitly and stop Node.js tasks first. Build and dist can contain published deliverables. Only recognized generated bundle names may bypass source protection; preserve authored scripts, tracked files, credentials and outputs that cannot be rebuilt." = "高风险：请手动选择，并先停止 Node.js 任务。build 与 dist 可能包含已经发布的交付物。仅识别出的生成包文件名可获得源码保护例外；请保留手写脚本、版本控制中的文件、凭据及无法重新构建的产物。";
